: << 'COMMENT'
This is a pipe separated value file.
It contains the paths of the dotfiles and
their respective package dependency.

Note:
- Lines starting with '#' are comments
- The only known variable is '${HOME}'
- This is a 4 column file separated by '|'
- Each column should use spaces to separate array

Structure:
#?        flag|path|target|dependency

Flags:
P = Populate/Preserved - Copy the target to the specified path
                          - ONLY if the target do not exist
                          - Preserved the target

S = Sync - Copy the target to the specified path
            - Overwrite the target
              - Ignore other targets that is not from the list
              - Ignore other targets that is not from the ./Configs

L = Link - Create symlinks to the target at the specified path
           - Create symlinks only if the target does not exist
           - Preserve existing files/symlinks (similar to P flag behavior)
           - Backup existing targets before linking

O = Overwrite - Copy the target to the specified path
                - Overwrite the target target
                - If Target is a directory, Overwrite EVERYTHING in the directory
                - If Target is a file, Overwrite the file

B = Backup - Backup the target
              - All P,S,O flags will also backup the target file/directory
COMMENT


 Hyde core files 
P|${HOME}/.config/hyde|config.toml themes|hyprland
L|${HOME}/.config/hypr|pyprland.toml windowrules.conf keybindings.conf userprefs.conf monitors.conf|hyprland
P|${HOME}/.config/hypr|shaders.conf workflows.conf animations.conf|hyprland
L|${HOME}/.config/hypr|nvidia.conf|hyprland nvidia-utils
S|${HOME}/.config/systemd|user|systemd
L|${HOME}/.local/state/hyde|hyprland.conf|hyprland

 Hyde core files -- uwsm 
P|${HOME}/.config/uwsm|env env-hyprland env.d env-hyprland.d|systemd hyprland uwsm

 Hyde core files -- xdg-terminal-exec 
P|${HOME}/.config|xdg-terminals.list|xdg-utils

L|${HOME}/.config/hypr|hyprland.conf|hyprland
L|${HOME}/.local/share|hypr|hyprland
O|${HOME}/.local/bin|hyde-shell hydectl|hyprland
S|${HOME}/.config|gtk-3.0|nwg-look
S|${HOME}/.config|nwg-look|nwg-look
S|${HOME}/.config|xsettingsd|nwg-look
S|${HOME}|.gtkrc-2.0|nwg-look
S|${HOME}/.config|Kvantum|kvantum
S|${HOME}/.config|qt5ct|qt5ct
S|${HOME}/.config|qt6ct|qt6ct
L|${HOME}/.config/hyde|wallbash|hyprland bash imagemagick
L|${HOME}/.config/hypr|animations|hyprland
L|${HOME}/.config/hypr|workflows|hyprland
L|${HOME}/.config/hypr|shaders|hyprland

L|${HOME}/.local/share|hyde|hyprland
L|${HOME}/.local/lib|hyde|hyprland
L|${HOME}/.local/share|wallbash|bash imagemagick

 Bar 
P|${HOME}/.config/waybar|config.jsonc style.css theme.css|waybar
L|${HOME}/.config/waybar|modules styles layouts menus user-style.css|waybar
L|${HOME}/.local/share|waybar|waybar

 Terminal 
# P|${HOME}/.config|fastfetch|fastfetch
# O|${HOME}/.local/share/fastfetch/presets|hyde|fastfetch


L|${HOME}/.config/kitty|hyde.conf theme.conf|kitty

 Shell 
# S|${HOME}/.config/fish|conf.d functions completions|fish
# P|${HOME}/.config/fish|config.fish|fish
# P|${HOME}/.config/starship|starship.toml|starship

 Vim 

# P|${HOME}/.config/vim|vimrc|vim
# S|${HOME}/.config/vim/colors|wallbash.vim|vim
# S|${HOME}/.config/vim|hyde.vim|vim

 File Explorer 
 TODO: Add stuff for Thunar 

 Input 
L|${HOME}/.config|libinput-gestures.conf|libinput-gestures

 Wayland 
L|${HOME}/.config|spotify-flags.conf|spotify
L|${HOME}/.config|electron-flags.conf|electron

 Notifications 
P|${HOME}/.config|dunst|dunst

 Gaming 
L|${HOME}/.config|MangoHud|mangohud

 Launcher 
L|${HOME}/.config|rofi|rofi
